// E0413: a `Task` is a key into a scheduler that dies with its region, so a
// region may not deliver one. This is the same result-type check `with_cell`
// uses on a cell, for the same reason — the value would name something that no
// longer exists.
//
// The fix is to join inside the region and deliver what the task returned.

test "a task may not outlive the region that made it" {
  simulate {
    task.spawn(|| 1)
  }
}
